### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/health

### List videos
GET http://127.0.0.1:3000/videos

### Initialize an MP4 upload
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/video-uploads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Salsa lesson summary",
  "fileName": "salsa-lesson.mp4",
  "contentType": "video/mp4"
}
